            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Yeh Board ki taraf se Class 12 Computer Science and Entrepreneurship ke paper ka pattern (pairing scheme) hai, jo kitab ke aakhir mein chhapa hai (printed page 137-138). Is se pata chalta hai ke paper mein kitne sawal aayenge, kis chapter se aayenge aur kitne karne hain. Neeche pehle poora paper aik table mein hai, phir har hisse ki tafseel kitab ke mutabiq."
