              "Sab se zyada marks: chapter 1 (Computer Networks) 16 marks ke sawal laata hai: 2 MCQs, 3 short aur 1 long sawal. Is ke baad chapter 3 (OOP) aur chapter 6 (Data and Analysis) 14 14, aur chapter 8 aur 9 13 13.",
              "Long sawal sirf chapter 1, 3, 6, 8 aur 9 se aate hain aur 5 mein se 3 karne hain. Kam az kam 4 chapters ke long sawal achhi tarah tayyar karein, taake koi aik mushkil ho to bhi 3 kar sakein.",
              "Chapter 7 (Hypothesis Testing) ka koi long sawal nahi, lekin sawal 4 ke 9 short sawalon mein se 5 isi chapter se hote hain. Is ke short sawal (H₀, H₁, p-value, significance level, test statistic) zaroor tayyar karein.",
